nly approv"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"approval is rejected by the backend. Approval pools let a trusted agent execute only approved plans."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Six root nodes; everything else grows by itself"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Agent + Agent** forms a Team that keeps both conversations and holds an internal discussion befo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"re assignments;\n- **Backlog pools** queue work that idle agents pull automatically;\n- **Scheduled Tr"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"iggers** run on a Host-owned timer that survives restarts;\n- **Skills** dragged onto an Agent or Tea"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"m bind capabilities for every later run."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Reports read like posts"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Click a Work Report, Answer, or Plan to open a **fullscreen detail page**: the producing agent leads"},{"id":"p13s2","text":", the body renders Markdown (tables included), and a status rail shows whether that agent is busy an"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"d what is queued. **Select any passage to raise a floating annotate button**; comments are relayed t"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"o the producing agent, whose status reply types out beneath your comment."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open the URL printed by DSH and pick **运筹 / Knotline** in the sidebar: choose a workspace on the ful"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"lscreen picker and hit \"Enter Knotline\" at the bottom right. A three-step guide greets first-time us"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"een picker and hit \"Enter Knotline\" at the bottom right. A three-step guide greets first-time users."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"See the Chinese product requirements document, docs/architecture.md for the runtime path, and docs/d"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"evelopment.md for local development."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Knotline is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It descends from the Dashi Taskboar